/T (The School of Journalism and Mass Communication is committed to developing skilled, ethical, and creative media professionals. It offers comprehensive education in journalism, digital media, public relations, advertising, and broadcasting. The curriculum blends theoretical knowledge with practical training through workshops, internships, and live projects. Students gain hands- on experience in modern media labs, learning content creation, reporting, editing, and multimedia production, The school emphasizes critical thinking, communication skills, and media ethics. Graduates are well-prepared for careers in journalism, television, radio, digital platforms, public relations, and corporate communication, contributing effectively to the dynamic and evolving media industry.)
